t 45 for that and eight times eleven is 88 now I need to add the top two numbers 88 plus 45 eight and five is thirteen and you get 13 there so you end up with 133 over 24. if you want to change that into a mixed number I'm gonna do a guess and check methods see how many times 24 goes into 133 C go ahead and we'll say five and we'll do 5 times 24 just to see how many are going to be left over 5 times 24 is 120 so that leaves a remainder of 13 left over so you get 5 and 13 24. and that's it see ya",
