      "start": "00:05:05.272",
      "text": " And you get 13 there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:14.748",
      "start": "00:05:09.976",
      "text": " So you end up with 133 over 24."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:19.753",
      "start": "00:05:14.748",
      "text": " If you want to change that into a mixed number,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:23.490",
      "start": "00:05:19.753",
      "text": " going to do a guess and check methods."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:29.996",
      "start": "00:05:23.490",
      "text": " See how many times 24 goes into 133."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:36.102",
      "start": "00:05:29.996",
      "text": " See, go ahead and we'll say 5."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:39.639",
      "start": "00:05:36.102",
      "text": " And we'll do 5 times 24."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:43.543",
      "start": "00:05:39.639",
      "text": " Just to see how many are going to be left over."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:47.981",
      "start": "00:05:43.543",
      "text": " 5 times 24 is 120."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:52.853",
      "start": "00:05:47.981",
      "text": " So that leaves a remainder of 13 left over."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:56.756",
      "start": "00:05:52.853",
      "text": " So you get 5 and 13, 24."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:58.158",
      "start": "00:05:56.756",
      "text": " And that's it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:59.559",
      "start": "00:05:58.158",
      "text": " See ya."
    }
  ],
